OL,3,ATrump's role in Jensen Huang's Nvidia
OL,4,Acomeback questioned by US politicians
OL,5,Aon both sides
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Trump's role in Jensen
OL,8,FHuang's comeback as Nvidia boss has
OL,9,Fbeen questioned by some US politicians
OL,10,Fon both sides - read a reaction
OL,11,Fround-up here
OL,13,FTrump says he "made the deal" to bring
OL,14,FHuang back to the AI giant - but one
OL,15,Fsenior Democrat tells the BBC: "Under
OL,16,Fno circumstances should a president of
OL,17,Fthe United States be meddling in a
OL,18,Fcorporate board of directors' decision"
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
