OL,3,ATrump's role in Jensen Huang's Nvidia
OL,4,Acomeback questioned by US politicians
OL,5,Aon both sides
OL,6,
OL,7,FHuang stepped down from Nvidia after
OL,8,Fadmitting to an affair with an alleged
OL,9,FChinese spy - he was also accused of an
OL,10,Faffair with a colleague. Here's a
OL,11,Ftimeline of how we got here
OL,13,FAfter his return was announced on
OL,14,FMonday, Nvidia shares jumped by 31% and
OL,15,Fmarkets also rose in Asia - although
OL,16,FNvidia is down in pre-trading on
OL,17,FTuesday
OL,19,FTrump has bought millions of dollars in
OL,20,FNvidia stock in the past two years,
OL,21,Falthough the White House says he
OL,22,Fdoesn't manage his own trades
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
